{
  "_comment": [
    "Boss rewards. The relic for a boss comes from a FIRST-KILL advancement reward (once per player), not from the entity loot table,",
    "so summonable/farmable bosses (Wither, respawned Dragon, Warden) cannot mint relics. Every player within 'party_radius' blocks",
    "of the kill is credited (KubeJS), so a party all gets the first-kill reward. 'repeat' is an extra entity drop on later kills",
    "(killed_by_player only): structure-bound bosses repeat-drop a lower relic; farmable ones drop nothing extra.",
    "tier: major -> Starforged Heart + trophy; mini -> Ancient Core + trophy.",
    "palette: [dark, mid, light, accent] hex colours for the generated trophy emblem."
  ],
